Mailing lists:
   ifreedom  (Intellectual Freedom)
         Email to "listserv@snoopy.ucis.dal.ca"
         with line "sub ifreedom <FULL NAME>"
   alaoif (American Library Assocation Office of Intellectual Freedom)
         Email to "listproc@ala.org" with line "sub alaoif <FULL NAME>"
   gaynet (Gay issues)
         Email to "listserv@queernet.org" with line "sub gaynet <FULL NAME>"
   comp-academic-freedom-abstracts (Weekly summary of
         alt.comp.acad-freedom.talk). Email to "listserv@eff.org" with line
         "add comp-academic-freedom-abstracts"
   efa (Computers and civil liberties in Australia). Email to
           "efa-request@iinet.com.au" with line "subscribe"
   amend1-l (Free Speech Issues -- American Communications Assocation).
         Email to "Listserv@uafsysb.uark.edu" with the line
         "sub AMEND1-L <your name>". For example, "sub AMEND1-L Bill Douglas"
   efc-announce (EFC's infrequent press releases)
   efc-talk  (EFC's discussion list)  Email to
	"efc-talk-request@insight.mcmaster.ca" with a "subscribe" message.

