Gophers:
  gopher aclu.org 6601
       (The American Civil Liberty Union)
  gopher -p"1/library/ala/ala-x" gopher.uic.edu 70
       (then select "ALA Intellectual Freedom Statements".
         The American Library Association)
  gopher gopher.eff.org
       (The Electronic Frontier Foundation. Of special interest
        is "gopher -p1/CAF/civil-liberty eff.org")
   gopher -p "1/org/efc" insight.mcmaster.ca
       (Electronic Frontier Canada)
  gopher -p1/orgs/alternet gopher.igc.apc.org
      Institute for Alternative Journalism's Alternative News Network.
      Includes items from the newsletters of many free-expression
      organizations.

